==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*3 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
**2 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring Holy Blast and a unit that can deal with Cadaver Bear. The other enemies don't pose that much of a threat, though keep in mind that aside from the Cadaver Bear are Dagshunds at 1000% magnification, which translates to '''600,000 HP''' and '''30,000 ATK''' so don't completely ignore them either.

